<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Metallurgical.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Metallurgical.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Oregon Metallurgical Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Said in a report that shares appear undervalued at recent prices.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 22-3/8.</p>
</text>
